{"id":"belgrade","name":"贝尔格莱德","en":"Belgrade","country":"Serbia","lat":44.8178,"lng":20.4569,"dek":"两河交汇处的白城，层层战火与重建。","history":"贝尔格莱德最早的定居痕迹可追溯到约七千年前的温查文明。公元前3世纪，凯尔特人在这里建立聚落，称之为辛吉杜努姆，随后罗马帝国将其纳入版图。斯拉夫语名字“Beograd”（白城）第一次出现在878年的文献中，但这座城市真正与塞尔维亚政治命运紧密相连，要等到1284年。那一年，匈牙利国王拉斯洛四世把贝尔格莱德作为礼物送给姐夫斯特凡·德拉古廷，使它第一次成为一位塞尔维亚君主的都城。\n\n此后的几个世纪里，贝尔格莱德在奥斯曼帝国与哈布斯堡王朝之间反复易手，成为中欧与东方势力拉锯的前线。1521年，苏莱曼一世攻占贝尔格莱德，城市大部分被夷为平地，随后逐渐变成一座拥有清真寺和集市、人口可能接近十万的东方城市。1594年，奥斯曼当局为镇压巴纳特起义，在弗拉查尔高地焚烧了圣萨瓦的遗骨。这一事件成为贝尔格莱德与塞尔维亚历史记忆中难以抹去的一页。\n\n1841年，贝尔格莱德确立为塞尔维亚公国首都。第一次世界大战中，它曾被奥匈帝国与德国军队占领，于1918年解放，随后成为南斯拉夫王国的首都。第二次世界大战期间，贝尔格莱德先遭纳粹德国空袭，后又经历盟军轰炸；南斯拉夫游击队与苏联红军于1944年10月20日解放该城。战后，铁托在此宣布成立南斯拉夫联邦人民共和国，贝尔格莱德成为工业中心与不结盟运动早期会议的地点。1999年科索沃战争期间，北约空袭再次给这座城市留下创伤。","culture":"贝尔格莱德的文化机构密度在东南欧城市中相当突出。塞尔维亚国家博物馆建于1844年，收藏包括《米罗斯拉夫福音书》在内的超过四十万件展品。尼古拉·特斯拉博物馆保存着这位科学家的约十六万件原始文献与大量私人物品。伊沃·安德里奇的大部分作品，包括《德里纳河大桥》，都完成于贝尔格莱德。这座城市也孕育了南斯拉夫新浪潮音乐，并在1990年代成为turbofolk这一音乐流派的中心之一，埃米尔·库斯图里察的金棕榈片《地下》同样出自这里。\n\n夜生活是贝尔格莱德城市性格的一部分。俱乐部通宵营业，夏夜里沿着萨瓦河与多瑙河停泊的船屋（splavovi）既是餐厅也是舞池。周末从波黑、克罗地亚和斯洛文尼亚来的游客，往往不是冲着首都身份而来，而是为了这里相对便宜的饮品、没有语言障碍的夜晚，以及一种仍然混合着巴尔干式松弛与旧大都市气质的氛围。","pull":"一座白城，因两河交汇而存在，也因反复争夺而坚韧。","sights":[{"name":"卡莱梅格丹堡垒与公园","orig":"Калемегдан","intro":"贝尔格莱德最早的聚落所在地，坐落于萨瓦河与多瑙河交汇处的崖岸上。如今是免费开放的堡垒与公园，城墙内分布着军事博物馆、几座教堂和动物园，适合俯瞰两河汇流的开阔景象。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D1%98%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%81_%D0%B4%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D0%B8_%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B5%D0%BA%D0%B5_%D0%A1%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5_%D0%B7%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8.jpg/960px-%D0%A1%D0%B2%D1%98%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%81_%D0%B4%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D0%B8_%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B5%D0%BA%D0%B5_%D0%A1%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5_%D0%B7%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalemegdan_Park"},{"name":"圣萨瓦寺","orig":"Храм Светог Саве","intro":"为纪念塞尔维亚东正教创始人圣萨瓦而建，选址在弗拉查尔高地，即1594年奥斯曼人焚烧其遗骨之处。它是贝尔格莱德最具视觉重量的宗教建筑之一，内部长期处于装饰进程中。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/%D0%A5%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC_%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B3_%D0%A1%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5_%D0%A1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3_%D1%83_%D0%91%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D1%83.jpg/960px-%D0%A5%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC_%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B3_%D0%A1%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5_%D0%A1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3_%D1%83_%D0%91%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D1%83.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E8%90%A8%E7%93%A6%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82"},{"name":"塞尔维亚国家博物馆","orig":"Народни музеј Србије","intro":"建于1844年，收藏超过四十万件展品，涵盖从史前到现代艺术的漫长跨度。镇馆之宝《米罗斯拉夫福音书》是塞尔维亚最重要的中世纪手抄本之一。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/National_Museum_of_Serbia_%28DSC04612%29.jpg/960px-National_Museum_of_Serbia_%28DSC04612%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":540},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A1%9E%E7%88%BE%E7%B6%AD%E4%BA%9E%E5%9C%8B%E5%AE%B6%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8"},{"name":"尼古拉·特斯拉博物馆","orig":"Музеј Николе Тесле","intro":"建于1952年，保存特斯拉的骨灰、约十六万件原始文献和数千件私人物品。馆藏中还包括他的实验装置与模型，是理解这位发明家在塞尔维亚人心目中地位的最佳入口。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Museum_of_Nikola_Tesla%2C_Belgrade%2C_Serbia-cropped.JPG/960px-Museum_of_Nikola_Tesla%2C_Belgrade%2C_Serbia-cropped.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":884},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%BC%E5%8F%A4%E6%8B%89%C2%B7%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8"},{"name":"泽蒙","orig":"Земун","intro":"多瑙河左岸的旧城区，曾是奥匈帝国边境城镇，因此保留着与贝尔格莱德老城明显不同的中欧小镇风貌。河边的餐馆和船屋密集，黄昏时沿着河岸走，能看到较慢的市井生活节奏。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Zemun_panorama_from_Gardo%C5%A1_tower.jpg/960px-Zemun_panorama_from_Gardo%C5%A1_tower.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":355},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%BD%E8%92%99"}],"foods":[{"name":"切瓦皮","orig":"ćevapi","intro":"无肠衣的小型肉卷，通常以牛肉或羊肉混合制成，用炭火烤后夹在扁面包里，配生洋葱和酸奶油。几乎出现在贝尔格莱德所有传统餐馆和街头摊档。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Cevapcici2.jpg/960px-Cevapcici2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%88%87%E7%93%A6%E7%9A%AE"},{"name":"普列斯卡维察","orig":"pljeskavica","intro":"塞尔维亚风味的烤肉饼，通常由多种肉混合制成，装在面饼或圆面包中，可加芝士、番茄酱或辣味调料。贝尔格莱德的快餐店和小店常把它当作招牌主食。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Pleskavitsa.JPG/960px-Pleskavitsa.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":763},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pljeskavica"},{"name":"卡拉乔杰瓦肉排","orig":"karađorđeva šnicla","intro":"填馅肉排，通常夹入酸奶油，外层裹面包屑后油煎或烤制，常配马铃薯和柠檬上桌。这道菜的名字来自塞尔维亚王室卡拉乔杰维奇家族。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Kara%C4%91or%C4%91eva_%C5%A1nicla.jpg/960px-Kara%C4%91or%C4%91eva_%C5%A1nicla.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":669},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kara%C4%91or%C4%91eva_%C5%A1nicla"},{"name":"布列克","orig":"burek","intro":"油酥面皮包裹奶酪、肉末、菠菜或马铃薯的烘饼。贝尔格莱德的烘焙店从清晨供应到深夜，习惯上常搭配可饮用酸奶一起食用。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/159_Trohanet.JPG/960px-159_Trohanet.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":714},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%83%E5%88%97%E5%85%8B"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e4/Belagerung_belgrad_1717.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":752},{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/Knez_Mihailova%2C_Serbia%2C_XIX_century.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":564}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[20.2213764,44.9154621],[20.225245,44.9070062],[20.2399466,44.9067193],[20.2525385,44.8939145],[20.2419942,44.8842235],[20.2612926,44.8826796],[20.2794188,44.8754228],[20.2858289,44.8447788],[20.2856918,44.833241],[20.3257447,44.8342507],[20.3328068,44.8098272],[20.3367239,44.808089],[20.3339619,44.8058144],[20.3353253,44.8011005],[20.333631,44.8003791],[20.336023,44.7898245],[20.3384687,44.7907875],[20.3382362,44.7883604],[20.3405086,44.7859144],[20.3417344,44.7872272],[20.3474466,44.7713203],[20.350986,44.7687822],[20.3398029,44.7558716],[20.3220093,44.7448572],[20.3160895,44.7387338],[20.3235092,44.7345531],[20.3359605,44.7308053],[20.343735,44.7301552],[20.3442583,44.7276733],[20.3436179,44.7275162],[20.3450306,44.7243651],[20.3461568,44.724501],[20.349741,44.7209764],[20.352145,44.7143627],[20.3633795,44.704606],[20.378806,44.7025927],[20.3830709,44.7030441],[20.3845248,44.7011631],[20.3855942,44.701649],[20.3847991,44.7032182],[20.3924066,44.7036702],[20.3963554,44.7025735],[20.4038881,44.6984458],[20.4097684,44.6992834],[20.4129839,44.7024603],[20.4192098,44.7021308],[20.4205666,44.7036837],[20.4217436,44.703492],[20.4213098,44.7019237],[20.4251744,44.6976337],[20.4279418,44.6980838],[20.4313251,44.694068],[20.4358368,44.6933579],[20.4402665,44.6905161],[20.4433374,44.6901534],[20.4452138,44.691016],[20.4491457,44.6880839],[20.4539572,44.6888231],[20.4529809,44.6911331],[20.4545181,44.6908805],[20.4550753,44.6919188],[20.4534174,44.6929137],[20.4571253,44.6957696],[20.4577283,44.6977556],[20.4559323,44.6992762],[20.4570013,44.7008391],[20.4614601,44.7027894],[20.4646634,44.701897],[20.4674388,44.7050131],[20.4711804,44.7053775],[20.4753542,44.7039532],[20.4760757